<title>JAPAN: Eisai rises on Alzheimer's drug sale news.</title>
<headline>Eisai rises on Alzheimer's drug sale news.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Eisai Co Ltd rose sharply on Tuesday afternoon, boosted by news that its drug for treating Alzheimer's disease is being marketed abroad, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0436 GMT, the share was 150 yen or 7.25 percent higher at 2,220 yen, and was the sixth-largest percentage gainer on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.</p>
</text>
